## 2. Per-feature count

| Bucket | Count | Notes |
|--------|------:|-------|
| AArch64 modules with dedicated smoke     |  28 | One smoke per module; alu and bind have 2+ smokes each. |
| AArch64 modules without dedicated smoke |   7 | cond, ctl, elf, frame, harv, take, main. |
| AArch64 total (`wc -l aarch64_*.oo`)    |  35 | 33 `aarch64_emit_*` + `aarch64_emit.oo` + `aarch64_main.oo`. |
| Total AArch64 lines                      | 6,048 | Sum of `wc -l` over all 35 files. |
| AArch64 smokes under `ooda/scripts/`     |  68 | Excluding 1 dispatch_wiring, 1 tier0_gates, 1 side. |
| Smoke-to-module ratio                    | 0.80 | 28 / 35 modules covered by a dedicated smoke. |
| Files at the 256-line ceiling            |   3 | int.oo, match.oo, ctl.oo (255 — within 1 of ceiling). |
| Files over 200 lines                     |   9 | alu, contract, fn, int, match, opt, secret, str, struct, float, ctl. |

The 7 modules without a dedicated smoke break down as:
- **Internal helpers**: `aarch64_emit_harv.oo` (lex/token helpers), `aarch64_main.oo` (side driver, no product path).
- **Subsumed features**: `aarch64_emit_cond.oo` is covered by if-prefix smokes; `aarch64_emit_take.oo` is covered by mix_smoke and bind_smoke; `aarch64_emit_frame.oo` is verified through the frame_test path in the dispatch.
- **Binary emitter**: `aarch64_emit_elf.oo` is exercised by every smoke that runs the produced GAS through clang; no standalone ELF smoke.
- **Untested path**: `aarch64_emit_ctl.oo` is not yet wired to a dedicated smoke; it is the only module in the dispatch that has no smoke and no test in the audit chain.

