## 5. Cross-references

- audit/aarch64-deep-dive.oot — pre-Tier-1 structural baseline (10 files, 1,388 lines); this doc supersedes its §2 file inventory.
- audit/aarch64-contract-coverage.oot — 16-feature contract coverage matrix; this doc's §1 / §2 are the matching module inventory.
- audit/aarch64-investigations.oot — Tier 0-4 port plan; this doc's §4 is the ranked short-list extracted from that plan.
- aarch64_emit.oo:127-171 — the 23-arm dispatch ladder; the 4 modules without smoke (cond, ctl, take, frame) are reachable only through this dispatch.
- oodac/aarch64_emit.oo:121-122 — the fail-closed invariant: `if !saw_main` and `if leftover` both `process_exit(1)`.
- scripts/aarch64_dispatch_wiring_smoke.oo — the smoke that asserts every import in aarch64_emit.oo:12-41 has a matching module on disk.
